== Legal Inox that the LLVM backend does not lower yet (docs/BACKEND_GAPS.md).
== The diagnostic must say the gap is in the backend, not in the program.
== When nested loops are implemented, move this program to tests/runtime.
Module Diagnostics.BackendGapNestedFor

Main :
    for I in 1..2
        for J in 1..2
            Put(I)
        ;
    ;
;
